    "Money set aside (savings, investments): it counts in net worth only, never in jars." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "lo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ເງິນທີ່ກັນໄວ້ (ເງິນຝາກ, ການລົງທຶນ): ນັບສະເພາະໃນຊັບສິນສຸດທິ, ບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນກະປຸກ."
