    },
    "Moonee does the math in the app and explains it. Moonee is not a licensed investment adviser." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "lo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moonee ຄິດໄລ່ທຸກຕົວເລກໃນແອັບ ແລະ ອະທິບາຍໃຫ້. Moonee ບໍ່ແມ່ນທີ່ປຶກສາການລົງທຶນທີ່ມີໃບອະນຸຍາດ."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moonee คำนวณทุกตัวเลขในแอปและอธิบายให้ Moonee ไม่ใช่ที่ปรึกษาการลงทุนที่มีใบอนุญาต"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moonee tính mọi con số trong app và giải thích cho bạn. Moonee không phải chuyên gia tư vấn đầu tư có giấy phép."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moonee has a plan to split it into your jars." : {
      "localizations" : {
